      "lines": [
        49,
        63
      ],
      "issue": "open/activate wait for any one visible page rather than exact target identity. Under future delayed show scenarios the old visible page may satisfy the wait before intended presentation.",
      "action": "Wait for expected selected label or a newly allocated label with the requested URL, then require shown label matches. Keep the later explicit equality assertions."
    },
    {
      "id": "R7",
