  "earlyReservationCounterexamples": [
    "While open ACK is held, require exact new label remains tracked and hidden; navigate away without manufacturing new permission, then resolve late ACK and confirm only its owner updates.",
    "On open timeout/uncertain creation, preserve failed owner until exact close ACK; opening another page must not erase that ownership or turn absence of a Promise result into absence of a native page.",
    "No numeric cap is adopted. A fourth explicit page may be created; unknown close/presentation blocks display for ownership reasons, never capacity."
  ],
  "abaCounterexamples": [
    "Use distinct A/B native labels with identical URL; capture old selection revision before A-B-A and require rejection after return to label A. URL equality is insufficient.",
    "Same-selected-page focus, collapse and task navigation must not advance task-local selection revision or revoke grant; a true different-label selection attempt advances revision even if withdrawal or hide fails."
  ],
